1
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:09,799
Fast aircraft and drones: a collision, an in-flight failure, a flash that blinds the cameras.

2
00:00:09,899 --> 00:00:12,923
When the view is lost, what should the screen say?

3
00:00:13,773 --> 00:00:17,159
MoVi declares what it has not observed.

4
00:00:17,259 --> 00:00:19,365
Three answers per track.

5
00:00:19,465 --> 00:00:20,760
I see it.

6
00:00:20,860 --> 00:00:23,883
I don't see it, but here is where it can be.

7
00:00:23,983 --> 00:00:25,556
Or: I don't know.

8
00:00:26,606 --> 00:00:33,427
In six flight scenarios, MoVi never said clear where an aircraft, a drone or a fragment was.

9
00:00:34,677 --> 00:00:40,025
An aircraft fails in flight at a hundred and thirty-five metres per second.

10
00:00:40,125 --> 00:00:49,079
MoVi infers the event and declares the cameras unreliable within one second, in sixty of sixty simulated runs.

11
00:00:49,179 --> 00:00:54,848
Low-energy debris stays inside the declared volume in fifty-eight of sixty.

12
00:00:55,898 --> 00:00:58,153
Two fast drones collide.

13
00:00:58,253 --> 00:01:04,349
MoVi warns of the close pass at least ten seconds ahead, in sixty of sixty runs.

14
00:01:04,449 --> 00:01:12,976
The collision is not yet declared as an event, but the region is kept: the fragments stayed inside it in sixty of sixty runs.

15
00:01:14,026 --> 00:01:17,156
A flash blinds every optical sensor.

16
00:01:17,256 --> 00:01:22,477
Radar alone keeps a region for every track, and identity is presumed.

17
00:01:24,027 --> 00:01:33,877
When continuity is lost, MoVi computes, in the motion model, how confidence falls, and grows the region to keep nine chances in ten.

18
00:01:33,977 --> 00:01:45,043
On public flight tracks, with a simulated sensor, the region held the aircraft eighty-five to eighty-nine times in a hundred, a little under target, mostly one route.

19
00:01:45,143 --> 00:01:48,571
In turns, seventy-three: a declared limit.

20
00:01:51,021 --> 00:01:55,986
Now MoVi rides on a drone, keeping the track of a fast drone ahead.

21
00:01:56,086 --> 00:02:00,091
Nearby, two drones collide: flash, smoke, debris.

22
00:02:00,191 --> 00:02:03,278
The cameras are declared unreliable.

23
00:02:03,378 --> 00:02:11,095
With the radar undisturbed, the tracked drone stayed inside its region in sixty of sixty simulated runs.

24
00:02:11,195 --> 00:02:18,399
With the radar blinded for up to two seconds: at least fifty-nine of sixty, and never a fragment called clear.

25
00:02:20,649 --> 00:02:28,174
The same approach works on a site: a drone behind a building, warned in time in two hundred of two hundred runs.

26
00:02:28,274 --> 00:02:31,575
And at short range: people, cars, trains.

27
00:02:32,625 --> 00:02:39,211
The limits: everything is simulated, with no physical sensor, and classes are labelled by hand.

28
00:02:39,311 --> 00:02:46,750
Next: a contact rule for fast collisions, state-of-the-art sensors, dedicated hardware, field trials.

29
00:02:46,850 --> 00:02:49,532
MoVi observes and warns.

30
00:02:49,632 --> 00:02:51,354
By SDMs.

